{"version":1,"id":"ella-langley-weren-t-for-the-wind","title":"Weren't For The Wind","artist":"Ella Langley","key":"Em","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/ella-langley/weren-t-for-the-wind/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Joybeth Taylor, Ella Langley and John Devin Clawson","chords":[{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#m","canonical":"F#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D9","canonical":"Dadd9","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,4,6],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: Dadd9"}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":21,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A","column":17,"beat":4},{"symbol":"E","column":20,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I wouldn't paint me as a heartbreaker","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"But I've said a few goodbyes","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I'd make a promise but I know later","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm bound to change my mind","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Depending on the weather, I'm goin'","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Hell, baby, nobody knows when","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, if it was a different time","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Might've been different in a different life","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe that plane wouldn't ever take off","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D9","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe that dust wouldn't fly off the drive","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe that tumbleweed and me","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Wouldn't leave every other sunrise","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe I'd settle down, dig in some roots","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D9","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Find me a farmhouse, find me you","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe I wouldn't be already gone again","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"If it weren't for the wind","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":22,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I wouldn't stay wonderin' what's out there","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":33,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I wouldn't saddle up on a breeze","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"I wouldn't disappear out of thin air","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","col